//
//  Debug.xcconfig
//  record-catch
//
//  Build-time configuration for the Debug build configuration (see ADR-0018, its 2026-10 CDP dev
//  addendum, and .github/instructions/ci-cd.instructions.md's frozen "Option B" build-time
//  configuration decision). Do NOT put secrets/tokens in this file — it is committed to source
//  control. The reference-data API bearer token is supplied at runtime via the DEBUG-only
//  REFERENCE_DATA_API_TOKEN environment variable (see ADR-0018 §5), never here.
//

// The CDP dev-environment reference-data API (fronted by the `reference-data-service` gateway
// path prefix — every route the app builds, e.g. `/api/v1/reference-data/species` and `/health`,
// is appended after this prefix, giving `.../reference-data-service/api/v1/reference-data/species`
// etc.). HTTPS, so no ATS exception is required. No trailing slash: `ReferenceDataEndpoint`
// appends paths with `URLComponents.path +=`, so a trailing slash would produce a doubled `//`.
// The `$()` escapes are required so xcconfig doesn't treat `//` as a line comment.
API_BASE_URL = https:$()/$()/mmo-cr-catch-recording-service.api.dev.cdp-int.defra.cloud/reference-data-service
